      "text": "Reading Practice: Finding the ticket window.",
      "sequence_id": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. Spencer wants to go to Shibuya.",
      "sequence_id": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "He asks a passer-by, \"Sumimasen. Shibuya e ikitain desu ga, kippu uriba wa doko desu ka?\" (Excuse me. I want to go to Shibuya; where is the ticket window?).",
      "sequence_id": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "The passer-by asks, \"Chikatetsu desu ka, JR-sen desu ka?\" (The subway or the JR line?).",
      "sequence_id": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. Spencer answers, \"Chikatetsu desu\" (The subway).",
      "sequence_id": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "The directions are difficult, so Mr. Spencer says, \"Sumimasen. Wakarimasen\" (I'm sorry. I don't understand).",
      "sequence_id": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "The kind passer-by says, \"Jaa, tsurete itte agemashoo\" (Then, I'll take you there), and walks with him.",
